          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.percona.com/blog/new-in-mongodb-4-4-hidden-index/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modern optimized builds briefly lock the collection at the start and end while yielding to reads and writes in between; the older Studio 3T description of database-wide foreground blocking throughout a build should not be applied to this process. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/",
