          ],
          "also": [
            "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/index_builds/README.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cost-governance inference: evaluate index-removal savings alongside workload-specific rebuild time and resource contention. These sources support a recovery-risk assessment, but do not establish a fixed Atlas rebuild fee or a general dollar estimate. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/",
          "note": null,
